<% locals.layout = 'layout' %>
<div class="container" style="padding:40px 0 70px;max-width:820px">

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px">
    <span style="display:inline-block;background:var(--secondary);color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.3rem .8rem;border-radius:50px">About</span>
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align:center;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.4rem);font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:.4em 0 .3em">About MathStudy.in</h1>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--mid);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 34px;line-height:1.7">
    Affordable, fully solved maths practice for every Indian student — built by the team behind the free learning portal <a href="https://vidaara.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">vidaara.org</a>.
  </p>

  <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;color:var(--mid);font-size:.97rem;line-height:1.85">

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:0 0 8px">What we do</h2>
    <p>MathStudy.in publishes downloadable maths e-books — chapter worksheets, case studies, practice tests and Olympiad papers — for Grades 1–12 and exams like JEE, CAT, CTET and IMO. Every single question in every book is solved step by step; no answer keys without working. Books are priced so a student can buy one for less than the cost of a notebook, and they arrive as clean A4 PDFs you can print as many times as you need.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Why we exist</h2>
    <p>MathStudy.in is the paid side of a larger mission. Its sister platform, <a href="https://vidaara.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">vidaara.org</a>, offers free courses, practice tests and study material to students of all grades — and the modest revenue from these e-books helps keep that free work going. When you buy a book here, you are also supporting free education for students who cannot pay.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">How we work</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0">
      <li>Content is written and checked chapter by chapter against the CBSE, ICSE and Olympiad syllabi — and when a reader reports an error, we fix the file and update it.</li>
      <li>Payments are simple UPI, verified by a real person, with your download delivered the same day and re-downloadable from your dashboard.</li>
      <li>Support is human: questions go to a person through our support ticket system, not a bot.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Questions, suggestions or corrections are always welcome: email <a href="mailto:admin@mathstudy.in" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">admin@mathstudy.in</a> or use the <a href="/support" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">contact page</a>.</p>

  </div>
</div>
